message: "If you use this tool or its calibration, please cite it as below."
title: "CoARA Action Planner"
abstract: >-
  A static, client-side web tool that self-assesses an institution against the
  ten commitments of the CoARA Agreement on Reforming Research Assessment and
  generates a prioritised, editable action plan. Multilingual (EN/ES/FR/DE).
  The open twin of the hosted Reform Assessment toolkit; the 24 diagnostic
  questions, the 47 calibrated actions with corpus-derived prevalence
  evidence (335 published action plans), and the prioritisation algorithm
  are published in readable form under CC BY 4.0.
